    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρῐμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<u>Leg.Gort.</u>, v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡραῖος</span>
			, <i>ripe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					571
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρίμη κριθή</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1446.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυες,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμφακες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.316
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.67
				</span></i>
			: <i>timely, in season,</i> of fish, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.Com.
				1.21
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὑπάρχοντός μοι κλήρου . . ὡρίμου
					σπαρῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					54.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρὸς ὡριμώτατος εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					9.9.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>marriageable,</i> fem. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρίμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
					8.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὥριμον</span>
			<i>bloom,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σευ τὸ ὥ. τέφρη κάψει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					1.38
				</span></i>
			.</div>
